VecToMorph Open, Arm C v0.1.0-research
Copyright 2026 VecToMorph contributors

The code and fine-tuned checkpoint in this edition are offered under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. This edition contains adapted inference
utilities and a fine-tuned DINOv2 model.

The encoder is based on DINOv2 by Meta Platforms and the timm implementation
by Ross Wightman and contributors. The base model is
https://huggingface.co/timm/vit_small_patch14_dinov2.lvd142m

Fine-tuning used MLL23, Acevedo PBC, KU-Optofil PBC and UNIVALI.
Their original records and recorded licenses are listed in SOURCES.md.
The original datasets are credited to their respective authors and retain
their separate licenses. No original microscopy images are included.
